<!doctype html><html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>Edit Barang — Stockify Pro</title><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link href="/style.css" rel="stylesheet"></head><body><div class="app-shell"><aside class="sidebar"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">s.</span><span>stockify<small>INVENTORY STUDIO</small></span></a><div class="side-label">WORKSPACE</div><a class="side-link active" href="/"><span class="side-icon">◫</span> Dashboard</a><a class="side-link" href="/add"><span class="side-icon">＋</span> Tambah barang</a><a class="side-link" href="/export"><span class="side-icon">↧</span> Export data</a><div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="profile-avatar">S</div><div class="profile-info"><strong>Store workspace</strong><small>Inventory manager</small></div></div></aside><main class="main-content"><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Workspace</a><span>/</span><strong>Edit barang</strong></div><div class="topbar-right"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>Database terhubung</span><div class="top-avatar">S</div></div></header><div class="page-content form-page"><section class="welcome-row"><div><div class="overline">KATALOG INVENTARIS ✳</div><h1>Edit barang<span>.</span></h1><p>Perbarui informasi barang agar data tetap akurat.</p></div></section><div class="form-layout"><section class="form-card"><div class="form-card-head"><div class="form-head-icon">✎</div><div><h2>Perbarui informasi</h2><p>SKU-<%= String(item.id).padStart(4,'0') %></p></div><span class="required-note">* Wajib diisi</span></div><form action="/edit/<%= item.id %>" method="POST" class="inventory-form"><% if(error){ %><div class="error-alert"><%= error %></div><% } %><div class="field-group"><label for="name">Nama barang <span>*</span></label><input id="name" name="name" maxlength="100" value="<%= item.name || '' %>" required></div><div class="field-group"><label for="category">Kategori <span>*</span></label><input id="category" name="category" maxlength="50" value="<%= item.category || '' %>" required></div><div class="field-row"><div class="field-group"><label for="quantity">Jumlah stok <span>*</span></label><div class="input-with-prefix"><input id="quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="<%= item.quantity ?? '' %>" required><span>unit</span></div></div><div class="field-group"><label for="price">Harga per unit <span>*</span></label><div class="input-with-prefix"><span>Rp</span><input id="price" name="price" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" value="<%= item.price ?? '' %>" required></div></div></div><div class="form-actions"><a href="/" class="cancel-link">Batal</a><button type="submit" class="btn btn-dark">Simpan perubahan <span>↗</span></button></div></form></section><aside class="form-tip"><div class="tip-spark">✳</div><h3>Small details matter.</h3><p>Perubahan akan langsung diperbarui di daftar inventaris setelah disimpan.</p><div class="tip-divider"></div><div class="tip-note"><span>✓</span> Periksa kembali jumlah stok dan harga sebelum menyimpan.</div></aside></div></div></main></div></body></html>